### Tautology-scan verdict

| Test | Catches wrong impl? |
|------|---------------------|
| Superseded-by accepted (round-trip) | YES — catches if v1HeaderKeys missing |
| Unknown-header NOT firing | Covered by the accepted case above |
| Unknown ref = error | YES — catches if cross-ref check absent |
| Open carrier = warning | YES — catches if openCarrierSupersededBy absent |
| Closed carrier = no warning | YES — catches inverted condition bug |
| Self-ref = error | YES — catches missing self-ref guard |
| Repeatable (two lines, no error) | YES — catches accidental singleton entry |

All 7 tests would catch a distinct wrong implementation. No tautologies.

### Dependencies

None — all changes are within this repo's Go source. No external deps,
no version bump, no migrate.go change.